# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Solar System 3D — Environment Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your actual values.
# Never commit the `.env` file to version control.
#
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database (REQUIRED)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PostgreSQL connection string (Neon, Supabase, local, etc.)
# Format: postgresql://user:password@host:port/database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host/solar_system

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# API Services
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FastAPI ML service URL (defaults to localhost:8000)
SPACEAI_URL=http://localhost:8000

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Telegram Bot (REQUIRED for bot functionality)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get from @BotFather on Telegram
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=1234567890:ABCdefGHIjklMNOpqrsTUVwxyz

# OpenCode Zen API key for AI chat responses
# Get from https://opencode.ai
OPENCODE_API_KEY=your_opencode_api_key_here

# Fallback model when rate limited (optional)
# Default: nemotron-3-ultra-free
OPENCODE_FALLBACK_MODEL=nemotron-3-ultra-free

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Monitoring & Observability (Optional)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sentry DSN for error tracking (free tier: 5k errors/month)
# Get from https://sentry.io
SENTRY_DSN=https://your-sentry-dsn@sentry.io/project-id

# Sentry auth token for source map uploads (optional, for better stack traces)
# Get from https://sentry.io/settings/account/api/auth-tokens/
SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN=your_sentry_auth_token

# Sentry organization and project slugs (for source map uploads)
SENTRY_ORG=your-org-slug
SENTRY_PROJECT=solar-system

# Sentry release name (optional, defaults to timestamp)
# SENTRY_RELEASE=v1.0.0

# Log level: debug, info, warn, error
# Default: info
LOG_LEVEL=info

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Security
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CORS allowed origin (use * for development, specific domain for production)
# Examples:
#   - Development: *
#   - Production: https://c34246beaef275.lhr.life
#   - Multiple: https://example.com,https://www.example.com
ALLOWED_ORIGIN=*

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment: development, production, test
# This is usually set automatically by the runtime
NODE_ENV=development

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend Configuration (Vite environment variables, VITE_ prefix required)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sentry DSN for frontend error tracking
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://your-sentry-dsn@sentry.io/project-id

# API base URL (leave empty for same-origin requests)
# Only needed if frontend and backend are on different domains
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com

# Enable analytics tracking (optional)
# VITE_ENABLE_ANALYTICS=true

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Development Only
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Express dev/prod server port (default: 5000). No reusePort — a stale server
# on the same port now fails loudly (EADDRINUSE) instead of silently sharing.
# PORT=5000

# FastAPI port (default: 8000). Must match SPACEAI_URL when changed.
# SPACEAI_PORT=8000

# Enable debug panels (default: true in development)
# VITE_DEBUG_MODE=true
